Privacy Policy – SMS Communications

Valley Kidney Center respects your privacy and is committed to protecting your personal information. This includes any mobile phone numbers or SMS consent you provide to us.

No mobile information will be shared with third parties or affiliates for marketing or promotional purposes. All the above categories exclude text messaging originator opt‑in data and consent; this information will not be shared with any third parties.

Mobile numbers provided for SMS communication will only be used for patient‑care notifications, appointment reminders, and direct communications related to Valley Kidney Center services.

By providing your mobile number, you consent to receive SMS messages from Valley Kidney Center. Message and data rates may apply. You may opt out at any time by replying STOP.
